<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>{{subject}}</title>
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f0f1e 0%, #1a1a2e 50%, #16213e 100%);
      color: #e2e8f0;
      line-height: 1.6;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }
    
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    
    .header {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px 20px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(34, 184, 235, 0.1) 0%, rgba(34, 184, 235, 0.05) 100%);
      border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #22b8eb;
    }
    
    .logo {
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #22b8eb;
      text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
    }
    
    .logo-icon {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
    }
    
    .content {
      background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.6);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 0 0 12px 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    }
    
    h1, h2, h3 {
      color: #22b8eb;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    
    h1 { font-size: 24px; }
    h2 { font-size: 20px; }
    h3 { font-size: 18px; }
    
    p {
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      color: #cbd5e1;
    }
    
    a {
      color: #22b8eb;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    
    a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
    
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #22b8eb 0%, #0ea5e9 100%);
      color: #0f172a !important;
      padding: 14px 28px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none !important;
      margin: 20px 0;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(34, 184, 235, 0.3);
      transition: transform 0.2s;
    }
    
    .button:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(34, 184, 235, 0.4);
    }
    
    .divider {
      height: 1px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #22b8eb, transparent);
      margin: 24px 0;
    }
    
    .info-box {
      background: rgba(34, 184, 235, 0.1);
      border-left: 4px solid #22b8eb;
      padding: 16px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
    }
    
    .warning-box {
      background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1);
      border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b;
      padding: 16px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
    }
    
    .success-box {
      background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1);
      border-left: 4px solid #10b981;
      padding: 16px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
    }
    
    .footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px 20px;
      margin-top: 30px;
    }
    
    .social-links {
      display: block;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    
    .social-link {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      background: rgba(34, 184, 235, 0.1);
      border-radius: 50%;
      transition: background 0.2s;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    
    .social-link:hover {
      background: rgba(34, 184, 235, 0.3);
    }
    
    .social-link img {
      width: 20px;
      height: 20px;
      display: block;
      margin: auto;
      filter: brightness(0) saturate(100%) invert(52%) sepia(85%) saturate(1446%) hue-rotate(164deg) brightness(97%) contrast(101%);
    }
    
    .donation-section {
      background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3);
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    
    .donation-button {
      display: inline-block;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b 0%, #d97706 100%);
      color: #0f172a !important;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none !important;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }
    
    .unsubscribe {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #64748b;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }
    
    .list {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
    }
    
    .list li {
      padding: 8px 0;
      padding-left: 24px;
      position: relative;
    }
    
    .list li:before {
      content: "✈";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      color: #22b8eb;
    }
    
    .highlight {
      color: #22b8eb;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    
    .text-danger {
      color: #ef4444;
    }
    
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .container {
        padding: 10px;
      }
      
      .content {
        padding: 20px;
      }
      
      .logo {
        font-size: 24px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <a href="{{frontendUrl}}" class="logo">
        <img src="{{frontendUrl}}/logo1478.png" class="logo-icon" alt="FlightJobs" width="40" height="40" style="border-radius: 8px;" />
      </a>
    </div>
    
    <div class="content">
      {{{body}}}
      
      <div class="divider"></div>
      
      <div class="donation-section">
        <p style="margin-bottom: 8px;">
          <strong>🙏 FlightJobs is free!</strong>
        </p>
        <p style="font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 12px;">
          If you enjoy using FlightJobs, please consider making a donation to help keep the servers running.
        </p>
        <a href="https://www.paypal.com/cgi-bin/webscr?cmd=_s-xclick&hosted_button_id=44VG35XYRJUCW" class="donation-button" target="_blank">
          Support via PayPal
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="footer">
      <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 12px;">
        Follow us on social media
      </p>
      <div class="social-links">
        <a href="https://discordapp.com/invite/xmpAWz7" class="social-link" target="_blank" title="Discord">
          <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/simple-icons@latest/icons/discord.svg" width="20" height="20" alt="Discord" style="filter: invert(48%) sepia(98%) saturate(1288%) hue-rotate(164deg) brightness(92%) contrast(101%);" />
        </a>
        <a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBHN8OG2yilRq3SrxAGaIaw" class="social-link" target="_blank" title="YouTube">
          <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/simple-icons@latest/icons/youtube.svg" width="20" height="20" alt="YouTube" style="filter: invert(48%) sepia(98%) saturate(1288%) hue-rotate(164deg) brightness(92%) contrast(101%);" />
        </a>
        <a href="https://fb.me/rhpa23" class="social-link" target="_blank" title="Facebook">
          <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/simple-icons@latest/icons/facebook.svg" width="20" height="20" alt="Facebook" style="filter: invert(48%) sepia(98%) saturate(1288%) hue-rotate(164deg) brightness(92%) contrast(101%);" />
        </a>
      </div>
      
      <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 12px;">
        Thanks for using FlightJobs!<br>
        <a href="{{frontendUrl}}" style="color: #22b8eb;">FlightJobs</a>
      </p>
      
      <p class="unsubscribe">
        If you prefer not to receive this type of communication, please 
        <a href="{{frontendUrl}}/email-unsubscribe?token={{userId}}" style="color: #22b8eb;">click here to unsubscribe</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
